WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:06.307
Theo: Skyler, keep your eye on the ball.

2
00:00:06.308 --> 00:00:12.131
Riley: That's right. Don't worry about Chatter.

3
00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:17.383
Chatter: Don’t hurry. Don’t worry!

4
00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:22.199
Sarah: Go, Skyler! Go, Red Team.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.211
Chatter: Go, Red Team!

6
00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:28.450
Skyler: Hey! Chatter is cheering for our team!

7
00:00:28.451 --> 00:00:39.323
Theo: Skyler, get the ball!

8
00:00:39.324 --> 00:00:41.969
Kelli: Yay, Skyler!

9
00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.132
Riley: Good job, Skyler!

10
00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:49.599
Skyler: I scored my first goal!

11
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.977
Chatter: Go, Red Team! Go, Blue!

12
00:00:52.978 --> 00:00:54.680
Ben: Did you hear that?

13
00:00:54.681 --> 00:00:58.939
Now Chatter is cheering for both teams!

14
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:07.860
Sarah: Oh no! The Blue Team scored another goal!

15
00:01:07.861 --> 00:01:09.745
Theo: The game is over.

16
00:01:09.746 --> 00:01:12.074
The Blue Team won.

17
00:01:12.075 --> 00:01:14.491
Riley: I had fun anyway.

18
00:01:14.492 --> 00:01:17.143
Theo: Me too.

19
00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:18.977
Chatter: Hooray for Red!

20
00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:22.746
Hooray for Blue!

21
00:01:22.747 --> 00:01:25.226
Red, blue, red, blue!

22
00:01:25.227 --> 00:01:27.883
Skyler: Chatter, you're so funny!

23
00:01:27.884 --> 00:01:31.404
I can't be mad because you make me laugh!

24
00:01:31.405 --> 00:01:34.426
Coach Ryan: You have a great parrot there!

25
00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:38.353
Skyler: A great parrot? But—

26
00:01:38.354 --> 00:01:40.669
Coach Tim: You should be proud of him.

27
00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:43.086
He's a very good sport.

28
00:01:43.087 --> 00:01:45.366
Skyler: Really?

29
00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.928
Coach Ryan: Yes. He cheered for both teams.

30
00:01:48.929 --> 00:01:51.820
Coach Tim: He knows that sports are fun.

31
00:01:51.821 --> 00:02:00.740
Skyler: That's right. Sports are fun, no matter who wins!

32
00:02:00.741 --> 00:02:04.044
Coach Tim: I think Chatter deserves a prize.

33
00:02:04.045 --> 00:02:12.346
Coach Ryan: For being the best sport!

34
00:02:12.347 --> 00:02:14.437
Skyler: Look, Chatter!

35
00:02:14.438 --> 00:02:18.668
Riley: A key chain with a red and blue ball on it!

36
00:02:18.669 --> 00:02:21.840
Chatter: Go, Red! Go, Blue!

37
00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.620
Kids: Ha-ha!

